# A reconnect during sleep (DMN-09): east holds Space when the machine
# goes to sleep at 500, which lets go of it. Pad A goes away at 600 and
# comes back with a new id at 1000, still asleep, and east goes down: the
# slot starts held, so it maps nothing. The wake at 1500 queries the
# session, which is unlocked and active, and ends the suspension; east
# does nothing until it is pressed again at 1900.
